Iridium 1.0.31 - Shop System Overhaul

🏪 Shop Management:
- Removed shop from web panel (CLI only now)
- Removed shop management from admin bot
- Time-based tariffs only (unlimited traffic)
- Removed YooKassa, Telegram Stars only

📋 Tariffs:
- Simplified: name + days + price in stars
- Display ordering (move up/down)
- Edit tariff properties
- Hard delete (complete removal)

🎁 Promo Codes:
- One user can use each code only once
- User-specific promos (for_telegram_id)
- Discount (%) and Free Period (days) types only
- Hard delete (complete removal)
- Fixed: free_period promo now creates/extends subscription immediately

💾 Backup:
- .clientbot.env included in backup
- Shop data (MongoDB) backed up automatically

🐛 Fixes:
- Added missing hysteria2_api.py module
- Fixed ModuleNotFoundError on CLI execution
